    {
      "name": ".Tree Indent",
      "id": "10229:19647",
      "description": "Spacer that sets a Tree Item's nesting depth via the exposed depth property (00–10). Indent = depth × 16px, matching the 16px chevron slot.\n\nWidth is content-driven — each variant holds depth × 16px units and hugs them. This is deliberate: fixed-size variants do NOT resize when swapped inside a nested instance (Figma limitation). Add depth by adding units; never resize the variant frame or convert to fixed widths.",
